    summary: `The BD Onclarity HPV Assay (Becton, Dickinson and Company) was approved by the FDA on 12 February 2018 (PMA P160037) to detect 14 high-risk HPV types in cervical specimens collected in BD SurePath vials, identifying types 16, 18 and 45. A panel-track supplement of 14 May 2024 (S017) extended the genotyping to identify types 16, 18, 31, 45, 51 and 52 individually and to report the others in groups (33/58, 35/39/68 and 56/59/66), added ThinPrep PreservCyt specimens and approved self-collected vaginal specimens. Supplements of 2 April 2026 and 14 August 2026 expanded the settings for self-collection and its transport and storage conditions.`,
