    summary: "Alinity m HR HPV (Abbott Molecular) was approved by the FDA on 1 November 2023 (PMA P230003) to detect HPV DNA in clinician-collected cervical specimens in ThinPrep PreservCyt solution or SurePath preservative fluid. It identifies types 16, 18 and 45 and reports the other high-risk genotypes in two groups (31/33/52/58 and 35/39/51/56/59/66/68), and is indicated for routine cervical screening including triage of ASC-US cytology, co-testing with cytology and primary HPV screening. A supplement of 10 September 2025 (S006) added self-collected vaginal specimens obtained in a health-care setting, when cervical sampling is contraindicated or cannot be obtained.",
    notes: [HPV_RESULT],
    approvals: [{ region: "US", year: 2023, indication: "Routine cervical screening including primary HPV screening (PMA P230003)" }],
